<title>ZIMBABWE: TABLE - Caps Holdings hikes quarter shr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Caps Holdings hikes quarter shr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		(million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		59.10     vs	19.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  8.76     vs	2.86</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.46     vs	1.14</p>
<p>    Attrib profit	   5.30     vs	1.72</p>
<p>    Turnover		124.43     vs	110.73</p>
<p>Full Name: Caps Holdings Limited.</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said its improved performance was sustainable provided the economic environment remained stable. Subject to this, it expected earnings per share generated in the first quarter to be maintained.</p>
<p>--Harare Newsroom: 263-4 72 52 27/8/9--</p>
